    "title": "William Paterson University Now To Offer \"Wet Classes\" In The Coming Spring Semester. - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Darin Morris ,\n14 hours ago Too long has William Paterson University catered all of their classes to parched, droughty students, while wet students are literally hung out to dry. In the 75 years that WPU has been around, not a single accommodation has been made for the wet. You’ve likely seen for yourself how unaccommodating... Read full article",
